  "details": "There are worlds that otherwise do not fit any of the existing Content Gating categories that I still would very much prefer to not see in my Friend Locations menu or in the World Search for a variety of reasons (made by a user I have blocked, bad memories of the world in general, etc.). \n\nAn option to manually add individual worlds to your content gating settings would be a good solution to this. It's already possible to do this with individual avatars via the \"hide avatar globally\" option so it'd only be fair for an option like it to exist for worlds.",
